# Rust
src-tauri/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Tauri: editor/tooling schemas for the capability system. Neither
# `cargo build` nor `cargo tauri build` recreates them, and neither needs them
# (verified by building with this directory absent), so they stay out of the
# history rather than being regenerated on a fresh clone.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# Build output collected by scripts/build.sh (reproducible from source)
dist/

# Generated by scripts/make_ui_harness.py
test/ui-harness.html

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Freebuff local project metadata
.freebuff/

# The updater signing key belongs outside the repository (~/.tauri/ExcelScry.key)
# and in a GitHub secret, never here. This is the belt to that pair of braces:
# its public half is meant to be committed, the private half never.
*.key

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
